---
/**
 * Icon.astro — small inline SVG icons (no icon font, no extra requests).
 * Brand marks: LinkedIn, GitHub (Simple Icons shapes); OSHWLab is drawn as a
 * generic chip. The rest are simple line icons. Decorative by default
 * (aria-hidden); pass `label` when the icon is the only content.
 */
